{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Photo Syft 以每日小習慣的方式協助清理相簿，透過重溫往年今日拍攝的照片，保留值得留念的，並檢視其餘照片是否刪除，藉此減少雲端儲存開支。程式沒有廣告與訂閱，亦不會上傳照片。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合相簿堆滿照片、希望降低儲存成本的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>每日分批整理相簿</h2>\n<p>Photo Syft 把照片按年份分組，可用日曆切換日期或前後移動，逐日重看相片庫。開啟照片可仔細查看、一次選取多張，或整日一起保留。確認刪除前會檢查選取內容，標示喜好項目，也可把照片移出待刪佇列。程式會統計已清理照片、已保留照片與估計釋出的儲存空間，並可設定每日提醒，協助培養整理習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-30-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-31-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-32-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-34-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Photo Syft</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T11:38:09.791775+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}